    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've got a really bad headache starting right now. it hit me super fast too, like it just slammed into me out of nowhere. i get migraines a lot so i'm thinking it's just a bad one, i'm feeling a bit nauseous too. should i just take my sumatriptan like i usually do for my migraines or is there something else i should do?",
